#: ../../content/applications/hr/employees.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo **Employees** centralizes :doc:`personnel files <employees/"
"new_employee>`, employment :doc:`contracts <payroll/contracts>`, "
"and :doc:`departmental hierarchies <employees/departments>` in one system. "
"In addition, each employee record tracks :doc:`certifications <employees/"
"certifications>` and :doc:`training <employees/learning>`, "
"earned :doc:`badges <employees/badges>`, and all assigned :doc:`equipment "
"<employees/equipment>`. Customizable :doc:`onboarding <employees/"
"onboarding>` and :doc:`offboarding <employees/offboarding>` programs ensure "
"all employees are trained and ready for work, and all required steps are "
"taken when they leave."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **Employees** :doc:`xodimlar shaxsiy hujjatlari <employees/"
"new_employee>`, mehnat :doc:`shartnomalari <payroll/contracts>` "
"va :doc:`bo'limlar ierarxiyasi <employees/departments>`ni bitta tizimda "
"markazlashtiradi. Bundan tashqari, har bir xodim yozuvi :doc:`sertifikatlar "
"<employees/certifications>` va :doc:`o'qitish <employees/learning>`, "
"olingan :doc:`nishonlar <employees/badges>` hamda barcha "
"biriktirilgan :doc:`jihozlar <employees/equipment>`ni kuzatib boradi. "
"Moslashtiriladigan :doc:`ishga qabul qilish (onboarding) <employees/"
"onboarding>` va :doc:`ishdan chiqarish (offboarding) <employees/"
"offboarding>` dasturlari barcha xodimlarning o'qitilgan va ishga tayyor "
"ekanligini, hamda ular ketganda barcha zarur qadamlar bajarilishini "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/employees.rst:16
msgid ""
"Properly configuring the settings in the **Employees** app ensures the "
"dashboard shows each employee's real-time attendance and work location—data "
"that drives payroll accuracy, capacity planning, and compliance reporting."
msgstr ""
"**Employees** ilovasidagi sozlamalarni to'g'ri sozlash boshqaruv panelida "
"har bir xodimning real vaqtdagi davomati va ish joyi ko'rsatilishini "
"ta'minlaydi — bu ma'lumotlar ish haqi hisob-kitobining aniqligi, quvvatni "
"rejalashtirish va muvofiqlik hisobotlari uchun asos bo'lib xizmat qiladi."

