msgstr "Ishdan ketish: ogohlantirish muddati va ishdan bo'shatish to'lovlari"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:423
msgid ""
"This documentation explains how the employee departure process works in the "
"application, focusing on the notice period calculation and severance pay "
"when the employee does not serve their notice period."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hujjat ilovada xodimning ishdan ketish jarayoni qanday ishlashini "
"tushuntiradi, bunda asosiy e'tibor ogohlantirish muddatini hisoblashga va "
"xodim ogohlantirish muddatini o'tamagan hollarda ishdan bo'shatish "
"nafaqasini hisoblashga qaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:430
msgid ""
"This module helps manage employee departures by determining the correct "
"notice period based on seniority, departure reasons, and specific country "
"regulations (Belgium). It also calculates severance pay when the employee "
"does not work during their notice period."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu modul ish stajiga, ishdan ketish sabablariga va muayyan mamlakat "
"qoidalariga (Belgiya) asoslanib to'g'ri ogohlantirish muddatini aniqlash "
"orqali xodimlarning ishdan ketishini boshqarishga yordam beradi. Shuningdek, "
"xodim ogohlantirish muddati davomida ishlamagan hollarda ishdan bo'shatish "
"nafaqasini hisoblaydi."

