#: ../../content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2473
msgid ""
"The Social Security certificate in Odoo provides a detailed breakdown of all "
"social charges paid by the employee or employer, categorized by type (e.g., "
"year-end bonus, private car reimbursement, double holiday pay, etc.). This "
"report is particularly useful for audit companies and for verifying that the "
"declared amounts align with accounting entries."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'dagi ijtimoiy sug'urta sertifikati xodim yoki ish beruvchi tomonidan "
"to'langan barcha ijtimoiy to'lovlarning turlari bo'yicha (masalan, yil "
"yakunidagi bonus, shaxsiy avtomobil xarajatlarini qoplash, ikki karra ta'til "
"puli va h.k.) tasniflangan batafsil tafsilotini taqdim etadi. Ushbu hisobot "
"ayniqsa audit kompaniyalari uchun hamda e'lon qilingan summalarning "
"buxgalteriya yozuvlariga mos kelishini tekshirish uchun foydalidir."

